# A Shift-drawn line let go past the edge of the home's land is laid up to the edge, as its
# preview showed while the pointer was on the land, not shrunk to its first tile (H3-011).
set clock day
set camera 30 32 1
wait 2
click ui:build
wait 3
click ui:tab:nature
wait 3
click ui:tile:flowers_white
wait 3
keydown shift
press @22,36
move @30,36
move @39,36
wait 2
move @44,36
wait 2
release @44,36
keyup shift
wait 2
expect count flowers_white 18
key ctrl+z
wait 2
expect count flowers_white 1
